 "variant_info": {
  "description": "FX-A feasibility design point (research s9, owner direction 2026-11-03): ~1,915 kg, \u00d81.10 m fan-wheels with \u00d80.90 m fans (2.36 m2 total), FM 0.90 with deployable 10 deg diffuser, TG900-TO (900 kW_e <=5 min, 600 kW_e cont), 311 kg Amprius-class buffer in the nose at x 1.80, avionics x 1.70, fuel in the tub centre bay at x -0.06, mass-reduction set R. Pod pivots moved to y +/-1.25 to clear the sill in VTOL pose. Every change is a DESIGN PROPOSAL, SYNTHETIC_UNVALIDATED.",
  "design_proposals": [
   "\u00d81.10 m fan-wheels, \u00d80.90 m fans, 2.36 m2 total disk (appearance cost: largest; fenders redrawn)",
   "Pod pivots y +/-1.04 -> +/-1.25 (packaging: clear the body sill in VTOL pose)",
   "Deployable 10 deg diffuser skirt, FM_open 0.80 -> 0.90",
   "TG900-TO single turbogenerator (900 kW_e <=5 min, 600 kW_e cont); induction area ~2x A9",
   "311 kg Amprius-class buffer in nose bay at x 1.80; avionics x 1.70 (owner approved CG fix)",
   "Fuel 129 kg in tub centre bay at x -0.06 (owner approved)",
   "Mass-reduction set R (structure, legs, HV, interior, avionics)",
   "Alternative (not active): CG study N2 nose battery 193 kg P50B at x 1.24 against front bulkhead, radiator moved forward, 18 kg avionics; mount design load ~53 kN forward"
  ]
 },
